This Java code will solve the problem of moving stacks on a pile. It keeps track of the final stack to be moved and updates it as needed. The function `movingStacks` takes an array of 2D arrays representing the initial stacks, and an integer `k` as input, which is the number of times we can move each stack one position at a time.
